<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Aug 19.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Aug 19.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Spot 83.50/84.00/85.00/85.50 Oct/Dec 92.00</p>
<p>West Norfolk Spot 87.00</p>
<p>Norfolk Oct/Dec 91.50</p>
<p>Nottinghamhire Spot 85.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Norfolk/Suffolk Spot 76.00/77.00/78.00/78.50 Oct/Dec 86.00</p>
<p>Avon Oct/Dec 86.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Harvest 77.00</p>
</text>
